# Route guides maintenance

Whenever you **implement or materially change** a page, section, or feature, update the matching guide under **`docs/guides/routes/`** in the **same change** — not as a follow-up.

## Which file to update

Mirror the app URL (omit dynamic params):

| Route                                                            | Guide path                                                                                       |
| ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `/sign-in`                                                       | `docs/guides/routes/sign-in.md`                                                                  |
| `/onboarding`                                                    | `docs/guides/routes/onboarding.md`                                                               |
| `/org`                                                           | `docs/guides/routes/org/selector.md`                                                             |
| `/org/:orgSlug/dashboard`                                        | `docs/guides/routes/org/dashboard.md`                                                            |
| `/org/:orgSlug/settings`                                         | `docs/guides/routes/org/settings.md`                                                             |
| `/org/:orgSlug/properties`                                       | `docs/guides/routes/org/properties.md`                                                           |
| `/org/:orgSlug/property/:propertySlug`                           | `docs/guides/routes/org/property/dashboard.md`                                                   |
| `…/bookings`                                                     | `docs/guides/routes/org/property/bookings.md`                                                    |
| `…/bookings/:bookingId`                                          | `docs/guides/routes/org/property/bookings-detail.md`                                             |
| `…/finance` · `…/maintenance` · `…/notifications` · `…/settings` | same segment under `org/property/`                                                               |
| `…/marketing` · `…/staff` · `…/operations`                       | redirect to `…/notifications?module=…` — see [notifications.md](./org/property/notifications.md) |
| `/` · `/calendar`                                                | `docs/guides/routes/calendar.md`                                                                 |
| `/form` · `/success` · `/sd-form`                                | `docs/guides/routes/{form,success,sd-form}.md`                                                   |
| `/bookings/:bookingId/parking`                                   | `docs/guides/routes/bookings/parking.md`                                                         |

Full index: **`docs/guides/routes/README.md`**. Workflow: **`.cursor/skills/route-guides/SKILL.md`**.

## What to document

Per page/section: **behavior**, **save paths**, **validation**, **API/edge functions**, **DB/storage columns**, **permissions**, **edge cases**, **implementation map** (UI + server paths).

Update the **Progress overview** table when section status changes. Mark guide **Status** from `Pending` → `Documented` when substantive.

## Relationship to other docs

| Doc                                  | Role                                                                  |
| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **`docs/guides/routes/*.md`**        | Per-route behavior spec (operator + agent reference)                  |
| **`docs/PROJECT.md`**                | Architecture, API inventory, env vars                                 |
| **`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`**            | Canonical invariants (booking workflow, auth) — link, don't duplicate |
| **`docs/planning/NEW_FLOW_PLAN.md`** | Redesign plan / decisions                                             |

New route → create guide from **`docs/guides/_template.md`**, add row to **`docs/guides/routes/README.md`**.

## When guides need no change

Typos, internal renames with no behavior change, or pure refactors that don't alter UX/API/validation.
